      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Low back pain is a common complaint among both the general and the athletic populations. A thorough evaluation and specific diagnosis is required before prescribing treatment. A complete rehabilitation program should include exercises to enhance strength, flexibility, endurance, and coordination. This article focuses on exercises to improve flexibility."},
